{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore amazing alien worlds and become the ultimate space medic hero! The Alien Adventure Expansion Pack takes you on 12 incredible missions to help friendly alien creatures who need your care. Each world brings new surprises and fun challenges that will test your skills and creativity!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover 5 awesome futuristic gadgets that make healing aliens super cool and exciting. You'll get to use special tools to help your alien friends feel better - from carefully fixing their unique alien systems to solving colorful puzzle circuits that power their technology. It's like being a space detective and helpful hero all in one!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every mission is a new adventure where you'll learn about different alien species while using your problem-solving skills and steady hands. Can you help all the aliens and become the best space medic in the galaxy?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761040?t=1754246387","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761040?t=1754246387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761040/bcab90d55a4a4577601cfcbd157963a9133562b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754246387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761040/bcab90d55a4a4577601cfcbd157963a9133562b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754246387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore amazing alien worlds and become the ultimate space medic hero! The Alien Adventure Expansion Pack takes you on 12 incredible missions to help friendly alie